Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.63,0:01:45.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Vampires really don't like mornings, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.33,0:01:51.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But still, having Lu living here with me\Nhas helped out in all sorts of ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:01:58.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We should be all set for lights now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:01.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.67,0:02:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But that's just basic magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.21,0:02:08.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This has a really mild flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:11.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you prefer not to use salt\Nwhen you cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.71,0:02:13.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nope. I just don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:14.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.63,0:02:15.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.17,0:02:18.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've been looking for it for a while,\Nbut I can't find any.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:20.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm at the point where I'm about to give u-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty intense look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.33,0:02:23.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:25.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.54,0:02:27.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is mostly salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:29.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can dissolve some\Nthen boil it to get salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:32.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you not notice while you were digging?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:36.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's a pretty intense look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.67,0:02:41.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.96,0:02:43.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.96,0:02:45.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What are we doing today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.79,0:02:47.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:49.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was planning to check on\Nhow the fruit trees are growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:50.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get washed up,\Nthen I'll head over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.79,0:02:57.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look at these.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.21,0:02:59.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you transplant them to the soil here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:02:59.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.25,0:03:02.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They need more time to grow\Nthan the vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.42,0:03:06.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I tried planting oranges\Nand peaches this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:08.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think I might plant chestnuts next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.50,0:03:12.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?\NI can't wait to see how they turn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.38,0:03:19.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The herb tea that Lu makes is pretty good,\Nbut I want to drink green tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.67,0:03:23.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I remember correctly,\Noolong tea and black tea
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:26.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are all made from processing\Nthe same leaves...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.79,0:03:32.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.21,0:03:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.79,0:03:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.67,0:03:45.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I understand that I was wrong\Nfor attacking you first!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.92,0:03:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've seen this situation play out before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.58,0:03:51.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please rescue me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.38,0:03:52.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.21,0:03:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.75,0:03:58.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.83,0:04:15.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nice to be able to use magic, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:16.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lu?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.08,0:04:20.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So this is where you were hiding, Lulucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.71,0:04:25.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop resisting and come in quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.00,0:04:29.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.08,0:04:33.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jeez... I can't believe you hid\Nin this forest of all places.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:36.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, a lot of stuff happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:38.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was an awful experience\NI just went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.75,0:04:41.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know. They did that to me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:43.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. They're pretty ruthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.67,0:04:48.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magic doesn't really affect them much,\Nplus they dodge spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.63,0:04:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fighting them is a death sentence...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.04,0:04:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They seem to have a shared experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.38,0:04:55.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.75,0:04:58.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who is this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.08,0:04:59.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:02.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, this person is, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:06.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.67,0:05:08.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your husband?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.13,0:05:10.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You and Lulucy are a couple?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.08,0:05:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:13.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm Hiraku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:17.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Her husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:20.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the first time she's called me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:23.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce myself properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.29,0:05:24.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Tia.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.21,0:05:27.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I'm an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:29.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,An angel? So...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That means you serve God, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.46,0:05:36.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nothing that important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.63,0:05:39.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're simply a race of warriors\Nthat have more muscles than brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.46,0:05:41.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:44.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was a brief time period when\Nwe were an object of worship, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.25,0:05:48.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So why is an angel like you\Nchasing down Lu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:50.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a bounty on her because of\Nall the damage she caused in town
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.17,0:05:52.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,when she went on a rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.04,0:05:53.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's a bounty on your head\Nbecause of a rampage?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.92,0:05:56.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah.\NThere was a really annoying noble
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:58.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,who kept forcing me to make\Nmedicine and drugs for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.71,0:06:00.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They were so incessant with their demands
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.13,0:06:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that I felt the need to\Nteach them a little lesson...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.75,0:06:03.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There was nothing little about that lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.79,0:06:06.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She spends all her time researching\Nstrange medicines and concoctions,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:08.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and then as soon as something bothers her...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.33,0:06:12.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,she starts blowing everything up!\NThat's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.25,0:06:14.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stop making it sound like this is\Nsomething I've done multiple times!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.63,0:06:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was just an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Regardless, the fact remains that you\Nbesmirched the honor of a noble!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:21.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how high your bounty is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:23.33,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,,They seem to get along pretty well.\N{\rSubtitle}Do you have any idea how high your bounty is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.54,0:06:26.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, I do think I went a little too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.13,0:06:29.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised at how willing\Nyou are to admit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.13,0:06:33.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,So anyways, the reason I ended up here\Nis because I was running from Tia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:36.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,After all, she is stronger than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:38.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But only a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.67,0:06:42.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lulucy, you really have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:46.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You never used to be the kind of person\Nwho would admit any weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.54,0:06:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.67,0:06:50.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I felt firsthand just how weak\NI really was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:51.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:53.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fighting that many at once\Nshould be against the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.83,0:06:54.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.33,0:06:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Putting that stuff aside...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:59.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,do you want to live here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:00.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Live here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:03.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes, here. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.04,0:07:07.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll show you around the crop fields and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.79,0:07:09.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll love it here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:11.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's get going, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:13.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.75,0:07:15.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These are the crop fields.\NWe grow lots of vegetables here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.83,0:07:21.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.25,0:07:24.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And this is our orchard. We have a lot of\Ndifferent kinds of fruit growing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:26.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.38,0:07:27.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And this...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:29.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,is Zabuton!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:34.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. That's about what I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.96,0:07:37.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe she doesn't like spiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.75,0:07:38.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.75,0:07:41.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're about to harvest some crops.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:43.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.33,0:07:45.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a lot of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:51.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you plant this all yourself, Hiraku?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.58,0:07:52.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:54.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I helped a little, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:57.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking we needed\Nanother set of hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:58.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're really saving us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:02.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? You mean I'm going to\Ndo farm work, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.38,0:08:03.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:04.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:07.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why does an angel like me have to\Nget her hands dirty with garden work?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:10.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Okay then, let's get started\Nwith the cabbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.71,0:08:19.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Give it a try just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:21.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,O-okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:30.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These are pretty heavy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.33,0:08:31.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Want to give it a taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:35.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.29,0:08:40.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, all I did was tear up some cabbage leaves\NI washed and sprinkle salt on them...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.75,0:08:48.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's delicious. Really!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.13,0:08:49.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.25,0:08:53.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fresh vegetables really do\Ntaste great, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:57.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah. And the ones you grow yourself\Ntaste even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.33,0:08:59.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:05.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think that's enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.67,0:09:07.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:09.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:13.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nice to have so much\Nbut harvesting them all is hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:17.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wish I could do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:22.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.08,0:09:26.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This vegetable you call a strawberry\Nis so sweet and tart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.54,0:09:27.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.54,0:09:31.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This farming work is a lot more\Nfulfilling than I expected it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:33.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You had fun today, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.17,0:09:36.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well then, that settles it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:39.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going to live here with us, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.08,0:09:39.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:41.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Right? Come on, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.83,0:09:44.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,My body won't be able to\Nhandle everything if I'm alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:46.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.33,0:09:48.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:11.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tia, this farming work\Nreally does suit you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:13.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Was that supposed to be a compliment?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.00,0:10:14.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.63,0:10:17.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Very well. We'll leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.17,0:10:19.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.25,0:10:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hiraku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.04,0:10:23.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can we make a lot more strawberries?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:28.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I really wish we could, but even if\Nwe expanded the crop fields,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.67,0:10:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't be able to keep up\Nwith all the harvesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:33.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think we're currently operating at\Nabout maximum capacity now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:35.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.54,0:10:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We really could use\Nsome more help around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.92,0:10:41.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can just work hard enough\Nto make up the difference, Tia.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What about you?\NAre you sure you haven't been slacking off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:47.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.79,0:10:50.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Besides, if we grow too much
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.79,0:10:53.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then we might not be able to finish\Neating everything that we harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.17,0:10:57.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's the new puppies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:11:00.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Their horns are already coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.54,0:11:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:08.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kuro and Yuki's children...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:11.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,had children of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.63,0:11:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They've become quite a large family of dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:19.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Before long, the puppies are going to\Ngo off and find partners of their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.08,0:11:21.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Does that mean even more puppies?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:26.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that you mention it,\Nthat hut isn't going to be big enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.00,0:11:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And so, we decided to build\Na dog area next to the orchard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.46,0:11:38.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks kind of like a horse stable,\Nbut I'd like to think that it turned out well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:41.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,For the record, I still haven't\Ncome up with names
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:43.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,for the next generation\Nafter Kuroone and his siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.67,0:11:45.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to give them names,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:49.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but there are so many of them that it's hard\Nto come up with names for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, Zabuton's children...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:55.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.42,0:12:04.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,...are riding the wind\Nand starting a new journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:07.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess they're all leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:11.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was planning on turning the orchard\Ninto their new home. Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:17.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like some of them are still\Nstaying behind with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.46,0:12:18.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm going to step out for a while, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.54,0:12:24.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're going off somewhere\Nand leaving us too, Tia?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:27.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No, I won't be gone for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.13,0:12:28.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:32.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I wonder what she's going off to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:34.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, she's be back before you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.88,0:12:36.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:37.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Farming Life...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:39.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,in Another...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.17,0:12:40.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,World
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.42,0:12:43.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A few days later,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.75,0:12:46.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Tia came back just like Lu said she would.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And she brought a bunch of girls with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.83,0:12:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're elves?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.13,0:12:54.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're high elves, but you can\Ncall us elves if you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.04,0:12:55.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:57.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please introduce yourselves, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.92,0:12:59.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:00.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Leef.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.00,0:13:01.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lecott.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:02.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Leezay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.17,0:13:03.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Leely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.17,0:13:04.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Leeta.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.17,0:13:05.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm Lees.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.17,0:13:06.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're all Le.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:09.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah, you mean our names?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.46,0:13:12.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We have similar names\Nbecause we're all related.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.67,0:13:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We came here after Tia suggested\Nthat we all move here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.58,0:13:18.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please let us all live here with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.83,0:13:20.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.54,0:13:24.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The truth is, they all share\Na very sad backstory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.42,0:13:28.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They all used to live in a village\Nfar to the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But most of their people were wiped out
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.33,0:13:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,after they got dragged into\Nthe war of the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.13,0:13:36.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Their race was scattered, and since then\Nthey've been wandering the land
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:40.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,looking for a place they could\Nsettle down and call home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:46.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We've been travelling through the woods\Ntrying to get by until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:50.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Without a place to settle down,\Nwe aren't able to repopulate our race.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:52.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We ask that you please help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.63,0:13:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:56.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can count on them to be\Nexcellent workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.75,0:13:58.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I implore you to help them as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:00.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think it's a good idea, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:03.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've heard the high elves are\Na very talented race.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.71,0:14:06.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're all still pretty young, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:10.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm the oldest one,\Nand I'm just over 400 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.29,0:14:13.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm the youngest, and I'm about 300.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.54,0:14:15.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't tell they're 100 years apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.25,0:14:19.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.54,0:14:23.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, we have a lot of different\Nroommates living here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:25.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but if you all promise to get along\Nthen I don't have any problem with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.08,0:14:28.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.17,0:14:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, who are the other roommates?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.63,0:14:35.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is Zabuton.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.92,0:14:39.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And these...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.75,0:14:40.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are the dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.13,0:14:46.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's about how\NI expected it to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:49.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The number of people living here\Nwent up all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.21,0:14:50.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so we needed to build\Nsomewhere for them all to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.33,0:14:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Lea said the seven of them\Nall wanted to live together,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:56.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so we decided to build them\None big house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.13,0:15:00.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,First, we started with the ditch\Nand the wooden fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:03.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, we made them their own toilet\Nand garbage disposal area.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.79,0:15:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was an unbreakable giant tree\Nthat's harder than steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:11.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He cut it like it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.38,0:15:15.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When it comes to construction,\Nthey know more than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.17,0:15:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And they're all really handy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.63,0:15:19.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I even got to learn a lot about\Nhow to process lumber
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.92,0:15:21.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and fit the logs together from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:24.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just followed their orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.21,0:15:26.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I focused on digging holes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.13,0:15:28.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and leveling the ground,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.29,0:15:31.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and gathering lumber for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.04,0:15:34.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It took us ten days, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.42,0:15:35.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:36.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:38.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:40.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's so much nicer than our little hut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.54,0:15:44.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Jealousy...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.50,0:15:46.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is he sulking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.96,0:15:48.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.00,0:15:52.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,But now I've learned it... their technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.79,0:15:57.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It might be a good idea to try rebuilding\Nthe little hut we've been sleeping in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.08,0:16:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The house is shaped like a long rectangle\Nthat stretches from east to west.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.33,0:16:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just past the entrance way,\Nthere's the large living room
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.25,0:16:06.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,that doubles as a dining room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.67,0:16:10.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's a place to work on things together,\Nor so they can all eat together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:15.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sitting on both the left and right sides of\Nthe living room are storage rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.67,0:16:17.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The living room is an open design\Nthat covers the first and second floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:19.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The lighting is done with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:23.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And the second floor rooms sit\Non top of the storage rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:26.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The second floor is where\Ntheir individual rooms are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I hope that this can become a home\Nwhere they feel safe and at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.75,0:16:44.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It looks like they've all\Ngotten used to life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:45.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:48.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The vegetable harvesting is going great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.08,0:16:49.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:52.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They're eating raw garlic they just picked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.96,0:16:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's pretty wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.42,0:16:56.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.50,0:16:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You use fire and you eat meat, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:01.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:02.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When I think of elves...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.21,0:17:06.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think of a race that lives in the woods\Nand is one with nature,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.21,0:17:08.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and hates fire and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:10.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get that silly idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.79,0:17:12.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.79,0:17:16.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How is anyone supposed to live\Nwithout using fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:18.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like I said, you're one with nature...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:19.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Can you be more specific?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.46,0:17:21.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.29,0:17:22.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You wake up with the sunrise,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:24.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and go to sleep when it sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.96,0:17:26.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You eat fruit from the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.67,0:17:28.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you love the forest trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:31.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you refuse to wear\Nanything made of metal...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.04,0:17:32.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Hiraku.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.58,0:17:33.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.79,0:17:35.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Please stop underestimating\Nhow harsh nature can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:39.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you tried living like that in the forest,\Nyou'd die right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.54,0:17:41.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:42.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:44.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They really are hardcore survivalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:48.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,By the way, as thanks for\Nletting us all live here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.04,0:17:51.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we were planning on doing some mining\Nand blacksmithing work for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.33,0:17:53.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Huh? You guys can do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.13,0:17:54.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:57.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'd like to start by building\Na furnace that can melt iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.25,0:18:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I always imagined that dwarves handled\Nall blacksmithing related work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.79,0:18:02.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess that's different in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.33,0:18:08.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Following Lea's instructions, they quickly\Nput together a smithing work station.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.08,0:18:10.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They put charcoal and\Niron sand taken from the river
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:13.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,into the earthen furnace and heat it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.25,0:18:15.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then they hammer the melted iron\Nto process it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.54,0:18:19.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:21.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Our civilization is advancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:23.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:25.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can really do everything, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.63,0:18:27.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, that tends to happen
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.08,0:18:30.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,when you spend the better part of\N200 years wandering without a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:31.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:34.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The only things we couldn't do...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.13,0:18:38.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,was settle down for good and reproduce!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.33,0:18:40.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, we already took care of one of those!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.00,0:18:42.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be for the best
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.92,0:18:45.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,if I didn't say anything about\Nthe second thing she mentioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.63,0:18:53.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm really happy you guys\Nall came to live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:54.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:57.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to hear that you feel that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:19:00.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's stop here for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.63,0:19:01.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.71,0:19:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I believe I saw a wheat field out over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.92,0:19:07.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we have one,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:11.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but we already processed all the wheat\Nwe harvested into flour so we could store it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.25,0:19:16.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If it's alright with you,\NI'd like to bake some bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:19.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Bread? Please go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:21.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.46,0:19:25.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you use this stuff, it makes the bread\Nrise up when it bakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.75,0:19:49.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That freshly baked bread tasted amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.00,0:19:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:56.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:20:00.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're all very happy to hear that you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.25,0:20:05.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That jar must have had a natural yeast\Nto make the bread rise inside of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.29,0:20:10.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that we can bake bread,\NI'd like to expand the wheat fields...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.17,0:20:15.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know it's a little late to be asking this,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:17.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but does this land we're on\Nbelong to anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.96,0:20:19.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You mean like this forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.75,0:20:20.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:25.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone owns this\Nparticular plot of land or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.33,0:20:28.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but I guess technically it's under\Nthe control of the demon lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:29.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The demon lord?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.13,0:20:31.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What the heck? That's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.67,0:20:33.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:36.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Um... do you think the demon lord\Nis going to have a problem
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.33,0:20:39.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,with me building all these\Ncrop fields and stuff here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.88,0:20:42.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.25,0:20:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Did you receive any kind of support\Nwhen you started building all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:47.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,No. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.83,0:20:49.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.21,0:20:54.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you built this on your own,\Nthen the land belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.13,0:20:56.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess that's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.83,0:20:58.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's how it works!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.29,0:21:09.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hiraku is really full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.79,0:21:12.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He surprised me a lot at first, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:16.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not only did he tame all those inferno wolves,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.67,0:21:19.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,but he tamed a demon spider, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He's definitely special.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:24.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And these crops...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.54,0:21:27.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is the soil here really good enough\Nto grow things like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.92,0:21:30.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who knows? I never asked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:34.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he has a very green thumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.25,0:21:39.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That said, it's surprising how lacking he is\Nin knowledge about the world around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:41.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ah! I know what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.33,0:21:47.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He was saying that he thought elves were\Na race that didn't use fire or eat meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.83,0:21:49.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.54,0:21:52.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He didn't seem to know\Nwhat angels are, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.79,0:21:55.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That goes a few steps beyond\Njust lacking some knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.96,0:21:57.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.25,0:22:08.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I haven't progressed on\Nbuilding the waterway in a while now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.00,0:22:11.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll ask Lea and the elves\Nto help me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.92,0:22:14.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's lots of work to do tomorrow.
